<title>MALI: Burkina leader in Mali for private sector forum.</title>
<headline>Burkina leader in Mali for private sector forum.</headline>
<dateline>BAMAKO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Blaise Compaore of Burkina Fasso arrived in Mali on Monday to help open a United Nations forum on the private sector, officials said.</p>
<p>The three-day meeting from Tuesday is being organised by the U.N. development agency UNDP to help mobilise support for private sector growth and map investment opportunities in Mali.</p>
</text>
